@@ -1321,6 +1321,11 @@ To get a sha256 password hash with a specific salt::
     {{ 'secretpassword' | password_hash('sha256', 'mysecretsalt') }}
     # => "$5$mysecretsalt$ReKNyDYjkKNqRVwouShhsEqZ3VOE8eoVO4exihOfvG4"
 
+To select the BCrypt ident/version when generating a password hash::
+
+    {{ 'secretpassword' | password_hash('blowfish', ident='2a') }}
+    # => a BCrypt hash beginning with "$2a$"
+
 An idempotent method to generate unique hashes per system is to use a salt that is consistent between runs::
 
     {{ 'secretpassword' | password_hash('sha512', 65534 | random(seed=inventory_hostname) | string) }}
